  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MENTAL HEALTH FOR CARE GIVERS FOR SAFER SPACES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life Bloom has over 18 years of experience working to support women and children in Nakuru County helping over 10,000 women through counseling and education services. In Naivasha there are a good number of care givers who work with Life Bloom on counter human trafficking and other local organizations that work within the GBV sector. This project envision to support and equip 20 care givers, provide peer learning and training, emotional support creating collective impact in the larger community.</narrative>
  </description>
